# Captured 2026-09-05 from a live GL.iNet GL-MT6000 (OpenWrt 21.02-SNAPSHOT),
# by connecting to /var/run/ubus/ubus.sock from the device itself.
#
# GROUND TRUTH. Every constant in this crate was derived from these bytes, not
# from recollection of libubox headers. See PROTOCOL.md.
